---
description: Auto-triggers be-structure-maintainer skill when project documentation, rules, or skill files change.
globs: AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, README.md, agent-os/rules/**/*.mdc, agent-os/skills/**/SKILL.md, agent-os/agents/*.md, agent-os/mcp/*.json, .mcp.example.json, .mcp.default.json
alwaysApply: false
---

When any matching file is created or modified, read and follow the be-structure-maintainer skill:
- Skill file: `agent-os/skills/be-structure-maintainer/SKILL.md`
- Run the sync checklist to ensure CLAUDE.md, README.md, and all rules/skills are consistent
- Verify domain structure tables match the actual directory layout
- Check that new domains/sub-domains are reflected in documentation
- When `agent-os/agents/` changes, ensure **AGENTS.md** custom subagents section stays in sync
